2026-04-06 13:43:37,431[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-bc575fe543a176c7] execute_python_code({"code": "import math\nfrom sympy import binomial\n\n# Total number of ways to distribute 6 meals\ntotal_ways = math.factorial(6)\n\n# Number of ways to choose 2 fish meals out of 3 for the pilots\nways_to_choose_fish_for_pilots = binomial(3, 2)\n\n# Number of ways to distribute the remaining 4 meals (1 fish, 3 steak) among 4 people\nways_to_distribute_remaining_meals = math.factorial(4)\n\n# Number of favorable outcomes\nfavorable_outcomes = ways_to_choose_fish_for_pilots * ways_to_distribute_remaining_meals\n\n# Probability in its simplest form\nprobability = favorable_outcomes / total_ways\n\n# Simplify the fraction\nm, n = probability.as_numer_denom()\n\n# Ensure gcd(m, n) = 1\ngcd_m_n = math.gcd(m, n)\nm_simplified, n_simplified = m // gcd_m_n, n // gcd_m_n\n\n# Calculate m + n\nresult = m_simplified + n_simplified\nresult", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
2026-04-06 13:43:37,437[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-81d4e8a1d157c55a] execute_python_code({"code": "from itertools import combinations\n\ndef is_valid_subset(subset):\n    for subset_10 in combinations(subset, 10):\n        for split in combinations(subset_10, 5):\n            group1 = list(split)\n            group2 = list(set(subset_10) - set(split))\n            if all(gcd(x, y) == 1 for x in group1 for y in group1) and all(gcd(x, y) != 1 for x in group2 for y in group2):\n                return True\n    return False\n\ndef gcd(a, b):\n    while b:\n        a, b = b, a % b\n    return a\n\ndef find_min_n():\n    for n in range(11, 99):\n        S = set(range(1, 99))\n        for subset in combinations(S, n):\n            if not is_valid_subset(subset):\n                return n\n    return None\n\nmin_n = find_min_n()\nmin_n", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
