2026-04-06 13:43:38,535[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-92778f8ec80fcf9c] execute_python_code({"code": "def min_non_empty_piles(n):\n    # Start with n piles, each having 1 pebble\n    piles = [1] * n\n\n    # Perform operations until we have only one pile left\n    while len(piles) > 1:\n        # Take the first two piles\n        pile1 = piles.pop(0)\n        pile2 = piles.pop(0)\n\n        # Create a new pile with the sum of the two piles\n        new_pile = pile1 + pile2\n\n        # Add the new pile back to the list\n        piles.append(new_pile)\n\n    # The length of the piles list now represents the number of non-empty piles\n    return len(piles)\n\n# Given n = 8\nn = 8\nresult = min_non_empty_piles(n)\nresult", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
