2026-04-06 13:43:44,599[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-862789aca42256da] execute_python_code({"code": "def min_non_empty_piles(n):\n    # Starting with n piles, each having 1 pebble\n    piles = [1] * n\n\n    # Perform moves until only one pile remains\n    while len(piles) > 1:\n        # Choose two piles with the maximum number of pebbles\n        max_pebbles = max(piles)\n        idx1 = piles.index(max_pebbles)\n        piles.pop(idx1)\n\n        # Remove a pebble from the chosen pile and create a new pile\n        piles[idx1] -= 1\n        if piles[idx1] == 0:\n            piles.pop(idx1)\n\n        # Add the new pile\n        piles.append(2 * max_pebbles)\n\n    return len(piles)\n\nmin_non_empty_piles(8)", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
