2026-04-06 14:39:23,162[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-8b72c0e5abd8e96d] execute_python_code({"code": "import itertools\n\n# Function to calculate the score of a given permutation of columns\ndef calculate_score(permutation):\n    # Generate all possible positions for rooks based on the permutation\n    positions = [(i + 1, permutation[i] + 1) for i in range(6)]\n    # Calculate the value of each square\n    values = [pos[0] + pos[1] for pos in positions]\n    # Return the minimum value among the values of the squares\n    return min(values)\n\n# Generate all permutations of the columns\npermutations = list(itertools.permutations(range(6)))\n\n# Calculate the score for each permutation and store the scores in a list\nscores = [calculate_score(p) for p in permutations]\n\n# Calculate the average score\naverage_score = sum(scores) / len(scores)\naverage_score", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
